    "updated_at": "2025-10-24T09:49:01Z",
    "body": "I wasn't thinking of supporting more color spaces. I was mainly thinking of a mostly editorial change where we convert a `PredefinedColorSpace` to a CSS color space on input and then pass that around in the model instead of a `PredefinedColorSpace` (which is just a string and devoid of meaning).",
