    "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:39:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-21T17:39:48Z",
    "body": "> This change looks okay. But I would like to see the follow-up issue discussed above. Can you file it?\r\n\r\nFiled https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11939, although I'm not 100% sure I represented your suggestion correct (I quoted it, to make sure I didn't mangle it). Feel free to update to be more precise.\r\n\r\n> Also, I think you should file the MDN issue as it's more likely it will get forgotten if we don't do it now.\r\n\r\nFiled https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42050. Unfortunately it looks like a lot of places need updating in MDN.",
